6d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五月二十六雨","author":"陈献章","text":"时雨时旸歌帝力，今年今雨卜年丰。\n路傍酒价知天道，何处醉乡眠此翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42159,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六月一日不雨","author":"陈献章","text":"窗眼阴晴晓未分，一年忧乐稍相寻。\n山林自惯清凉极，且放今朝到铄金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42160,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"图新书舍中植蕉数本壁间李世卿题句潮州饶鉴至读之有所兴起勉以小诗","author":"陈献章","text":"一寸芳心卷却春，竹枝遗响落图新。\n潮州客子来何暮，还对芭蕉索楚人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42161,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠梁景行赴春闱","author":"陈献章","text":"宗烈平生读书处，老夫题作小壶山。\n壶山不解留君住，君著壶山梦里看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42162,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦亡友袁德纯侍御 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"再试宜兴割鸡手，置之柏府公岩岩。\n如何不返龙川驾，遗恨千年在岭南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42163,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦亡友袁德纯侍御 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"自别君来十九秋，江门暮雨忽相投。\n当时呼酒留君语，却到于今羡海鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42164,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"周侍御文化将访白沙阻风江上连日以诗迓之 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"长风不打画船回，更为山灵扫玉台。\n走马城中具茶果，青天白日绣衣来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42165,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"周侍御文化将访白沙阻风江上连日以诗迓之 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"将晴积雨此何时，我病山中久不知。\n骢马今朝在何处，江边人吏望旌旗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42166,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"周侍御文化将访白沙阻风江上连日以诗迓之 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"昔者吾闻周柱史，青牛紫气出函关。\n有心来鼓南溟柁，信息朝来已到山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42167,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀胡大参希仁 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"鲁连谢去都无事，范蠡归来未了心。\n三十馀年穷学道，而今方识古人深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42168,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀胡大参希仁 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"先生齿发今如何，我发秋来白又多。\n若与先生论出处，江门只好听渔歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42169,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅下杂诗 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"虚名每被诗家卖，素艳常遭俗眼媸。\n闻向人间非得计，移根天上白龙池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42170,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅下杂诗 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"向暖南枝已播诗，北枝向冷尚迟迟。\n肩舆欲过江门去，争得春风剪拂之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42171,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅下杂诗 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"梅花信是菊花传，赏到梅花又一年。\n处士岂非诗俊杰，长官元是酒神仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42172,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题瑞鹊巷","author":"陈献章","text":"瑞鹊多年我眼中，笑烹牛鼎夜灯同。\n如今柏府开诗卷，还对樽前两病翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42173,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠化州守郑顺解官归","author":"陈献章","text":"湖上鸱夷久买舟，清风明月几宜休。\n未知进退存亡事，只问归来郑化州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42174,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠罗梁还程乡 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"一峰诸子在通家，生死交情俗可嗟。\n泉壤有知开口笑，江门来去看梅花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42175,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠罗梁还程乡 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"飞出一帆何处风，道人眠处玉台东。\n春光一路相随去，朝雨渡头花欲红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42176,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠罗梁还程乡 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"世道如今觉我非，冲寒犹肯到柴扉。\n江门春酒无多少，须劝罗生一醉归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42177,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠罗梁还程乡 其四","author":"陈献章","text":"翩翩双屦一长筇，意气凭凌四百峰。\n肯向程乡留一载，长官真好主人翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42178,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠罗梁还程乡 其五","author":"陈献章","text":"一客三旬住玉台，梅花正傍玉台开。\n客心暗与梅花契，去到明年腊又来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42179,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓬岛烟霞图赠罗定直","author":"陈献章","text":"丹青谁弄烟霞笔，题赠湖西公子行。\n携过罗浮莫开看，罗浮怕有异人争。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42180,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽林别驾汝和 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"昔岁逢君在郁台，扬眉抚剑泰山摧。\n纷纷白眼轻豪俊，只有余公解爱才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42181,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽林别驾汝和 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"别驾一城聊塞北，短檠诸子自江南。\n平生抱负何由见，冢上铭诗仔细参。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42182,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽林别驾汝和 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"赤冈经雨草萋萋，山北山南路欲迷。\n怕到使君投辖处，黑云堆陇鹧鸪啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42183,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽林别驾汝和 其四","author":"陈献章","text":"有时江畔倚秋藤，袅袅如闻击楫声。\n春色眼前人不见，江花江水总含情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42184,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"县取脚色","author":"陈献章","text":"萧萧白发映春漪，脚色年来自不知。\n满眼江山难具报，只将年月载公移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42185,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]